### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 1. Create an event with 10 seats
POST http://localhost:8080/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Jazz Night", "seatCount": 10}

### 2. List the seats (note the seat ids)
GET http://localhost:8080/events/1/seats

### 3. Hold seats 1 and 2 (change the ids to match step 2). Run it twice: the second answer is a replay (200), not a new booking
POST http://localhost:8080/events/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-123

{"seatIds": [1, 2]}

### 4. Try to hold the same seats without a key: 409, seat already held
POST http://localhost:8080/events/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"seatIds": [1]}

### 5. Look at the booking
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/1

### 6. Confirm it
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings/1/confirm

### 7. Confirm again: 409, a confirmed booking cannot change
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings/1/confirm

### 8. Cancel another pending booking (id 2) to release its seats
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings/2/cancel

### 9. Event summary: total and available seats
GET http://localhost:8080/events/1
